      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Analyze the attached image from Cloudinary. Write an engaging, highly authentic, and creative social media caption that sounds like a human creator, not a generic corporate bot. \n\nStructure the post like this:\n1. THE HOOK: Start with an attention-grabbing first line (use a relatable question, a bold statement, or an exciting update).\n2. THE BODY: Explain the value of what's in the image in a friendly, enthusiastic, and conversational tone. Use short paragraphs and clear spacing.\n3. CALL TO ACTION (CTA): End with a clear action for the audience (e.g., \"Drop a comment below!\", \"Click the link in our bio to try it out!\").\n4. HASHTAGS: Include 5 relevant, trending hashtags at the very bottom.\n\nSTRICT RULES: \n- Do NOT include any introductory lines like \"Here is your caption:\". Start directly with the hook.\n- Do NOT use markdown symbols like asterisks (**) or dashes (---).\n- Mix in a few natural emojis, but don't overdo it. Keep it clean and readable.",
